<title>FRANCE: Euro Disney 9-mo oper revs up 10.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Euro Disney 9-mo oper revs up 10.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 3,674    up 10.6 pct</p>
<p>     - includes Q3 to June 30		  1,537    vs    1,423</p>
<p>NOTE - Euro Disney SCA, 39 percent owned by The Walt Disney Co, said fiscal 1997 third-quarter operating revenues for the Disneyland Paris theme park, hotels and Disney Village rose eight percent from the year-earlier quarter.</p>
<p>&quot;This increase in revenues was driven principally by growth in park attendance and hotel occupancy, combined with a small increase in average guest spending throughout the resort,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>For the nine months, operating revenues rose 10.6 percent, it said.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
